# Backdrop for the whole screen: the inside of the network.
#
# Tiles seamlessly — the traces run edge to edge, so the join lands mid-trace
# where there is nothing to line up. The node blocks sit well inside the tile
# for the same reason.
name battlegrid-bg
size 32 32
key d void-0-deep
key m void-1
key n void-2
pixels
*5 ddddddmdddddddddddddddmddddddddd
dddddnnndddddddddddddnnndddddddd
mmmmmmnmmmmmmmmmmmmmmnmmmmmmmmmm
dddddnnndddddddddddddnnndddddddd
*13 ddddddmdddddddddddddddmddddddddd
dddddnnndddddddddddddnnndddddddd
mmmmmmnmmmmmmmmmmmmmmnmmmmmmmmmm
dddddnnndddddddddddddnnndddddddd
*8 ddddddmdddddddddddddddmddddddddd
